  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency livelihood support to the fishing communities in Hodeidah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is directed at providing essential items for economic and food insecure fishers affected by the ongoing conflict to allow them to return to fishing, increasing the food supply to local markets and securing income and food for their families. At the same time increasing the safety of fishermen at sea.</narrative>
  </description>
